# The noise channel's priority, alone. tick 0: enemy killed ($02); tick 5:
# enemy explosion ($03) cuts it off. tick 40: Metroid killed ($0D); tick 45: a
# bomb ($0C) cannot interrupt it, nor Samus hurt ($06) at tick 50; tick 60: $FF
# stops it; tick 70: the bomb again, with nothing playing. tick 110: the
# Omega Metroid explosion ($0E); tick 115: an enemy shot ($01) cannot cut it
# off. tick 200: cleared save file ($0F); tick 205: acid damage ($07) cannot
# either. Six seconds.
